#: ../../getting_started/guides/instance_tabs.rst:139
msgid "Defining Plugin Settings"
msgstr "Plugin-Einstellungen definieren"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/instance_tabs.rst:141
msgid ""
"The plugin settings are defined in the `plugin definition "
"<https://github.com/martezr/morpheus-datadog-instance-tab-"
"plugin/blob/main/src/main/groovy/com/morpheusdata/tab/DataDogTabPlugin.groovy>`_"
" file as inputs similar to inputs used in other areas of the |morpheus| "
"platform. One item of note is the ``fieldName`` which is used as the "
"reference for when retrieving the value specified from within the code."
msgstr "Die Plugin-Einstellungen werden in der Datei `plugin definition <https://github.com/martezr/morpheus-datadog-instance-tab-plugin/blob/main/src/main/groovy/com/morpheusdata/tab/DataDogTabPlugin.groovy>`_ als Eingaben definiert, ähnlich wie Eingaben in anderen Bereichen der |morpheus|-Plattform. Besonders wichtig ist ``fieldName``, das als Referenz beim Abrufen des im Code angegebenen Werts dient."

#: ../../getting_started/guides/instance_tabs.rst:143
msgid ""
"this.settings << new OptionType(\n"
"        name: 'API Key',\n"
"        code: 'datadog-plugin-api-key',\n"
"        fieldName: 'ddApiKey',\n"
"        displayOrder: 0,\n"
"        fieldLabel: 'API Key',\n"
"        helpText: 'The DataDog API key',\n"
"        required: true,\n"
"        inputType: OptionType.InputType.PASSWORD\n"
")"
